{'symbol': 'DE', 'date': '2023-05-31 12:13:00', 'title': 'DEERE & COMPANY ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MOLINE, ILL. , MAY 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE DEERE & COMPANY (NYSE: DE) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.25 PER SHARE PAYABLE AUGUST 8, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 30, 2023.'}